<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia has expelled the United Arab Emirates ambassador after accusing Abu Dhabi of converting civilian airfields in Somaliland and Puntland into military bases and of funding armed groups that undermine national unity. Federal forces have quietly relaunched the previously failed Banooda operation, moving a major troop convoy, while Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport and later repelled the attackers. The United States has reversed its position, now funding UN military support in Somalia for another year after previously withdrawing funding for international military support, and it conducted airstrikes against al-Shabab at three locations. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5vdjZUR2NpZnRyQnBLX0k3RDZfM0NLUEFRcFY3cmxBaDRXVzNMTnBSU2R2b1ZEUnBNREhwd3BaVnFLZm9oTTBBUE5vN2FVNkRETjdMUGxMTkVFcGh6cVNzT2JSeUEtSDNfQWpkOG1sZTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNSnV0MDRuY1JrYUZMQVVwazI2R0UzQ0E5RTdsWDVVdm53cTNJMEdjbmhaeU5ELXdScDVOUFpVaGd2QTdFTEhVbkk1S09vank4dG1OSkhib00yZjI1XzlpUHA5TXd3VEdHdkJCSjh6VVlIWFFUeWRJQXlPSkVQV3d3TThGT25yRmQ4UVdvbER0b1lYbUVLWW9xNEJGYzF6Y2dmUkNHU1h1X1BWRzZBb0h4YUxIX1J5VDZr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Open Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Republic World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNTjVIMXZ5LVBaNnJval8xQ3dlcGFaS1BfblpvcXppQVRPdFo3R05xLW40dXRlUGEtUGo1RVB0NXFEMzg5NVZ5NldvQW9oTEZocHl1X09YSWYyZV9rUHhBVFpWYWkzX0VvS3ZpQWEwN2JaNjJ5Q20yMVFWNHdPcy1BcGZhYkd6NHlSRzRQVE5Lb2Y0YlZLZFZjbmdEVlJIME1tbFNxdHJSb3ZEX1owaUMtY0ZrU045NzJZeU02YzFpT2JxR21NdTZn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=